---
/**
 * HeritagePage — Reusable section composition for /<locale>/heritage/.
 * Called from 3 locale route files; all locale-specific content lives inline.
 *
 * Sections: Hero · Turkish Gateway context · Global Network (dark) · Curatorial Mandate · Asymmetric gallery · CTA
 */
